    "detailed_description": "<h1>UPDATES AND ANNOUNCEMENTS</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3111570/extras/72448cb208bc7da476e8db416348964c.avif?t=1739556611\" width=616 height=248 /></span></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><strong>Welcome to the adventure of a sword lost in a dark dungeon! In Only One Sword, you'll embark on an epic journey through dungeons. As our hero, a sword, you'll defeat enemies and massive bosses, collect coins and souls to gain new abilities, and grow stronger with each level. Remember, your master is waiting for you on the surface. You must escape this dungeon stronger than ever!</strong>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Welcome to the adventure of a sword lost in a dark dungeon! In Only One Sword, you'll embark on an epic journey through dungeons. As our hero, a sword, you'll defeat enemies and massive bosses, collect coins and souls to gain new abilities, and grow stronger with each level. Remember, your master is waiting for you on the surface. You must escape this dungeon stronger than ever!</strong>",
